abstract: "This manuscript presents a minimal variational formulation of the dynamical core of the Codex Alpha theoretical framework. It derives an informational extension of Einstein field equations from an explicit action principle involving the spacetime metric, a scalar coherence field, ordinary matter fields, and a coherence-weighted Schwinger functional."
